    "whyDuo": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "page": "duo",
      "text": "iPhone Duo\n\n• Cover: the tab rail sits on the right and rows stop at it (T-447)\n• Open: the tab bar becomes a sidebar; Library, Account and Settings get list and detail side by side\n• Sheets become inspectors beside the content (filters, comments)\n• Book pose: nothing crosses the fold; the reader shows one page per pane",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 1092,
      "y": 0
    },
    "whyIphone": {
      "page": "iphone",
      "text": "What changes on every iPhone\n\n• Floating glass tab bar; Search gets its own button (Tab role .search)\n• Large titles and grouped sections in system type and spacing\n• Glass toolbar groups on Work Detail and the Reader\n• Read Aloud lives in a bottom accessory, like Music's mini player\n• The four symbols (Rating, Category, Warnings, Status) on every work, same order everywhere\n• Density kept: words, chapters, kudos and hits stay visible",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 4700,
      "y": 0
    }
